292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (City Bank PLC is one of the oldest private commercial banks in Bangladesh. The bank provides products and services in retail banking, corporate finance, SME finance, digital banking, asset management, equity brokerage, and securities. It was founded in 1983 by 12 local entrepreneurs, who commenced the journey with only BDT 34 million worth of capital, which now is a respectable BDT 3.3 billion as capital and reserve.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (Deen Muhammad, chairman of the Phoenix group, was the founder of City Bank PLC. It was formerly registered as The City Bank Limited. It opened its first branch on BB Avenue in Dhaka. It was listed on the Dhaka Stock Exchange in 1986, and later it was listed on the Chittagong Stock Exchange in 1995.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
