297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (The ownership is split between the general public, institutional shareholders, the bank's original sponsors, and directors. The largest portion of the bank's equity is held by the general public. The remaining ownership structure is rounded out by local institutional investors and foreign shareholders. The government also retains a nominal share.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
