299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (City Bank PLC has developed from a traditional retail bank into a diversified financial institution with a strong presence in Bangladesh. It currently operates branches and sub-branches across the country and has expanded its international presence through operations in Malaysia and Hong Kong. The bank serves a wide range of customers through retail, corporate, SME, digital, Islamic, and other specialized financial services. Its continued investment in digital banking, innovation, customer service, and diversified financial products has strengthened its position in Bangladesh's competitive private banking sector.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
