/P 127 0 R
/E (The day to day operations of City Bank PLC are managed by Mashrur Arefin, who serves as the Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer \(MD & CEO\). Under the MD & CEO, several Deputy Managing Directors \(DMDs\) lead major business and functional areas, including wholesale banking, small and microfinance, agent banking, and medium business. The reporting structure extends through senior executives, executive vice presidents, vice presidents, and other managerial levels to individual branches and operational units. This structure enables the bank to allocate responsibilities clearly and maintain effective coordination across its different business areas.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
