326 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (City Bank PLC run its business in a way different from most other Bangladeshi banks. The bank is divided into four centralized business divisions that operate directly from the Headquarter. These are Corporate and Investment Banking, Retail Banking \(including Cards\), SME Banking, and Treasury and Market Risk. All these divisions sit on top of a single real time online banking platform allowing bank to treat retail customers, corporate clients, and small businesses as three distinct markets with tailored products, rather than serving everyone through the same branch counter. SME Banking is built around dedicated SME and agri-branches and SME service centres. The bank has been open about wanting to go deeper into this segment by including calls to widen SME product access and opening new SME centres across the country.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
