/P 129 0 R
/E (Corporate and Investment Banking serves large businesses and institutions through working capital finance, trade finance \(letters of credit and guarantees\), project finance, structured finance, supply chain finance, cash management, and investment banking advisory. City Bank has been one of the largest banks in country supporting the corporate sector. In 2025, it recorded the highest trade business volume in Bangladesh at roughly USD 8.01 billion.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
