342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (Digital banking is now a product line in its own way rather than just a delivery channel. City Bank is the first bank in Bangladesh to launch a full digital banking app CityTouch which offers more than 100 self-service features. Recently it has been redesigned with a more modern user interface. It also got some upgraded features such as instant digital account opening, instant loan disbursement, biometric login, virtual card issuance, and an AI chatbot for customer support. Apart from this, City Bank has proposed City Alo, a banking proposition designed for women and City Islamic, a Shariah-compliant Islamic Banking window next to its conventional products)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
