<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (In the early 2026, the ACC initiated formal legal proceedings following an in-depth BFIU investigation into the unauthorized withdrawal and layering of BDT 11.84 Crore from corporate accounts managed by City Bank PLC. Senior relationship officers in the Institutional Banking Division collaborated with outside parties to execute unapproved Real-Time Gross Settlement \(RTGS\) fund transfers using forged documents.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
