>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1102 0 R
/E (Unapproved RTGS transfers were executed using fake signature cards and fabricated transfer requests. The funds were transferred to multiple layering accounts to obscure the transaction chain before being withdrawn or converted into assets. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
