/E (Impact on Financial Performance: The unauthorized withdrawal and subsequent layering of BDT 11.84 crore created a significant financial risk for City Bank PLC. The bank could face direct financial losses, recovery costs, investigation expenses, and possible legal or regulatory consequences. The incident also highlights the financial risks associated with weaknesses in transaction authorization and monitoring systems)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
