/E (City Bank PLC has grown into a diversified and competitive private commercial bank in Bangladesh. It has delivered solid financial results, broadened its services, and invested in digital banking, financial inclusion, and sustainability. Between 2021 and 2025 its CRAR stayed above the regulatory minimum, while profitability and shareholder returns improved overall.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (The analysis also underlines the need for stronger internal controls and compliance. Unauthorized RTGS transactions revealed gaps in verification, staff oversight, and prompt reporting of suspicious activity. The bank has responded by expanding its AML team and enhancing automated monitoring and sanctions screening.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
